they don't eat angels, but they do eat just about everything else. It
makes life much easier. Even with angel's magic missiles doing
significant damage, I was able to visit all three altars without ever
seriously being in danger. I did kill one of my worms, alas, by
accident, with a WoD, which meant my god was mad at me. But he let me
ascend, so I guess it doesn't make that much difference.


